    "name": "TKP Sunlife Hotel",
    "detail": " The location is great! We stayed there for one night to catch the early morning flight next day. It's just a few minutes or so from Hakata station chikushi exit. You can see the hotel from the station. If it's raining really hard, you can go down to the subway station and walk to the exit #6 (east). You will be right in front of the hotel's entrance! If you have lots of luggages or your luggages are heavy, going down to the subway station might be a little bit tough though, because i'm not sure if there's an elevator or not... It was really easy to get to the Fukuoka airport next morning. It's only 2 stops away (i think it was like 240 or 260yen) . I would recommend this hotel to anyone who are looking for an easy access to the Fukuoka airport or JR station.",
